[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6480.47, "timestamp": "01:48:00", "text": "很貴。即使對普通人來說，它通常也很昂貴。是的。你知道，這跟外國人不一樣，因為醫療咖啡館的重點主要不在於食物，而在於人、娛樂和主題。所以，如果你去任何一家餐館"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6481.827, "timestamp": "01:48:01", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "how about macca?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6482.87, "timestamp": "01:48:02", "text": "，你都會知道"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6484.449, "timestamp": "01:48:04", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "for alcohol, I rarely like clear alcohol. I prefer aged alcohol like whiskey or brandy"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6485.109, "timestamp": "01:48:05", "text": "食物會"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6509.27, "timestamp": "01:48:29", "text": "頓飯。炸豬排飯，你打算用什麼價格買到它？ 2000日元，2500日元。價格"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6510.87, "timestamp": "01:48:30", "text": "很正常。但是，如果你喜歡 Metap 這樣的餐廳，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6523.27, "timestamp": "01:48:43", "text": "你會吃到最難吃的食物，而且價格非常貴"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6525.35, "timestamp": "01:48:45", "text": "。  我需要穩定一下貨幣兌換的情況。你會習慣的。關於貨幣，關鍵在於，這是一個以現金為主的經濟體系。雖然你可以使用銀行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6527.109, "timestamp": "01:48:47", "text": "卡，但我建議你隨時"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6529.35, "timestamp": "01:48:49", "text": "攜帶錢包。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6533.35, "timestamp": "01:48:53", "text": "如果你要用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6534.79, "timestamp": "01:48:54", "text": "錢包，好吧，這跟男人沒什麼關係，尤其是男人，聽"}]